<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1751844392"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:49.106"><div begin="22.483" end="52.052" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="22.483" end="26.425" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.483" end="23.488">微光潮汐</span><span begin="23.488" end="24.472">繁华千寻</span><span begin="24.472" end="25.472">在深海中</span><span begin="25.472" end="26.425">潜行</span></p><p begin="28.917" end="35.494" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.917" end="29.427">我唱</span><span begin="29.427" end="30.066">吟</span> <span begin="30.692" end="31.374">蔚蓝色</span><span begin="31.374" end="32.292">寰宇赋予</span><span begin="32.292" end="33.750">我的回应多</span><span begin="33.750" end="34.041">冷</span><span begin="34.041" end="35.494">清</span></p><p begin="38.811" end="43.238" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.811" end="39.763">孤单频率</span><span begin="39.763" end="40.742">万籁寂静</span><span begin="40.742" end="41.776">在时间里</span><span begin="41.776" end="42.075">旅</span><span begin="42.075" end="43.238">行</span></p><p begin="45.144" end="52.052" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.144" end="45.634">我迁</span><span begin="45.634" end="46.123">徙</span> <span begin="46.197" end="47.083">这海域</span> <span begin="47.130" end="48.497">继续前行我</span><span begin="48.497" end="49.308">独一无</span><span begin="49.308" end="49.794">二</span><span begin="49.794" end="50.076">的</span><span begin="50.076" end="50.671">轨</span><span begin="50.671" end="52.052">迹</span></p></div><div begin="53.300" end="1:08.838" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="53.300" end="57.286" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.300" end="54.012">我等你</span><span begin="54.012" end="54.665">靠近</span><span begin="54.761" end="55.028">等</span><span begin="55.028" end="55.478">来</span><span begin="55.478" end="56.094">海啸</span><span begin="56.094" end="56.793">入</span><span begin="56.793" end="57.286">侵</span></p><p begin="57.296" end="1:01.711" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><s